stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Setup : pick teams from WPBA roster CSV
    Setup --> Regulation : PERIOD_START Q1

    state "Regulation Q1-Q4 (team fouls reset each quarter, penalty at 5)" as Regulation {
        [*] --> Normal
        Normal --> LastTwoRules : LAST_TWO_START tapped at 2:00 (S2)
        LastTwoRules --> Normal : PERIOD_START next quarter disarms marker
    }

    Regulation --> Ended : Q4 ends, score not tied
    Regulation --> Overtime : Q4 ends tied (jump ball, A/P after tip)

    state "Overtime 3:00 (FRESH foul count, penalty at 2 - S9)" as Overtime {
        [*] --> OTNormal
        OTNormal --> OTLastTwo : LAST_TWO_START at OT 2:00 mark
    }
    note right of Overtime : Each team gets 1 fresh 30s timeout, no carryover

    Overtime --> Ended : OT ends, not tied
    Overtime --> SuddenDeath : OT ends tied

    state "Double OT - SUDDEN DEATH (S10)" as SuddenDeath
    note right of SuddenDeath : First score of any kind wins. A made FT counts, an offensive foul does not.

    SuddenDeath --> Ended : FIRST SCORE
    Ended --> [*] : GAME_END, quarterPointsReducer finalizes the 7-point split
